206	    /// subsequently execute the function call encoded in `data`.
207	    ///
208	    /// Note: This primitive does not include an authorization mechanism. To
209	    /// restrict who can upgrade, enforce access control in your contract
210	    /// before delegating to this function.
211	    ///
212	    /// # Arguments
213	    ///
214	    /// * `&mut self` - Write access to the contract's state.
215	    /// * `new_implementation` - The address of the new implementation contract.
216	    /// * `data` - Additional data to be passed to the new implementation.
