233	    ///   [`delegate_call`][delegate_call] fails with a specific reason.
234	    ///
235	    /// # Events
236	    ///
237	    /// * [`crate::proxy::erc1967::Upgraded`]: Emitted when the implementation
238	    ///   is upgraded.
239	    ///
240	    /// [delegate_call]: stylus_sdk::call::delegate_call
