509	    /// [`delegate_call`].
510	    ///
511	    /// This allows a function to be callable on the implementing contract
512	    /// but not through proxies.
513	    ///
514	    /// # Arguments
515	    ///
516	    /// * `&self` - Read access to the contract's state.
517	    ///
518	    /// # Errors
