   612	    /// # Arguments
   613	    ///
   614	    /// * `&self` - Read access to the contract's state.
   615	    /// * `token` - Address of the ERC-20 token contract.
   616	    /// * `spender` - Account that will spend the tokens.
   617	    ///
   618	    /// # Errors
   619	    ///
   620	    /// * [`Error::SafeErc20FailedOperation`] - If the contract fails to read
   621	    ///   `spender`'s allowance.
   622	    fn allowance(
